---
/** Footer: ganti next/image ke <img> biasa */
---
<div>
  <footer class="bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 mt-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 text-center">
      <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
        <img
          src="/images/PNG_LOGO_PENGASIH.png"
          alt="University Logo"
          class="h-7 w-7 mx-3"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <span class="text-sm">
          © {new Date().getFullYear()} KKN-PPM UGM YO-062 — Kalurahan Margosari, Pengasih
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-8">
        <div class="text-left md:text-center md:col-span-1">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Tentang</h3>
          <p class="text-sm">
            Program KKN-PPM UGM YO-062 bertujuan mendukung pemberdayaan masyarakat melalui kegiatan inovatif dan berkelanjutan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-left md:text-center">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Kontak</h3>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-2">
            <li>Lokasi: Kapanewon Pengasih, Kulon Progo</li>
            <li>Instagram: @meraih.pengasih</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="text-left md:text-center">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Tautan</h3>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-2">
            <li><a class="hover:underline" href="/">Beranda</a></li>
            <li><a class="hover:underline" href="/program">Program</a></li>
            <li><a class="hover:underline" href="/kalipetir">Ekowisata</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>

